{
    "title": "winwalk - it pays to walk",
    "description": "<b>Get Paid to Walk & Win Gift Cards</b>\r\nWinwalk is the best step counter app to transform your daily walks into real rewards! Our free pedometer pays you to walk by turning your steps into coins that you can exchange for gift cards from top brands. Whether you're walking your dog, strolling through the park, or just tracking your fitness activity, winwalk will motivate you to walk more to reach the healthy target of 10,000 daily steps.\r\n\r\n<b>Key Winwalk Features</b>\r\n\ud83d\udeb6 Accurate Step Counter & Pedometer\r\n- Precise step tracking using your phone's built-in sensors or Google Fit\r\n- Track steps, distance walked, calories burned, and active time\r\n- Compatible with all major fitness trackers and smartwatches via Google Fit\r\n- Syncs with Google Fit for enhanced accuracy and reduced battery usage\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcb0 Walk and Earn Real Rewards\r\n- Earn 1 coin for every 100 steps you take\r\n- Collect up to 100 coins daily by reaching your 10,000 steps goal\r\n- Exchange coins for popular gift cards (Amazon, Walmart, Google Play, and more)\r\n- Instant rewards delivery - no waiting time for payouts\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd12 Private & Secure\r\n- No registration or personal info required\r\n- Anonymous step tracking without GPS monitoring\r\n- Free to use with no hidden fees or subscriptions\r\n- Simple and easy-to-use walking app\r\n\r\n<b>How to Earn Money Walking?</b>\r\n1. Download our free step tracker app\r\n2. Start walking and collect coins\r\n3. Participate in extra missions to maximize your earnings\r\n4. Redeem coins for gift cards in the rewards shop\r\n5. Receive your gift card instantly in the app\r\n\r\n<b>Smartwatch Integration</b>\r\nConnect your favorite fitness devices through Google Fit (and soon Health Connect): Fitbit step tracker, Samsung Health smartwatch, Garmin fitness tracker, Mi Band - And many more!\r\nConnecting your smartwatch to Google Fit may require the use of a third-party app like Health Connect, Health Sync or Da Fit app.\r\n\r\n<b>How is Winwalk different from other rewarded walking apps?</b>\r\nWinwalk offers instant rewards without complicated requirements. Our lightweight walking app focuses on simplicity and ease of use - just walk and earn. Winwalk can work alongside Weward, Macadam, Sweatcoin and Cashwalk. However, our walking app doesn't sync with other step counter & pedometer apps except Google Fit.\r\n\r\n<b>How accurate is the step counter?</b>\r\nOur pedometer uses your phone's built-in step sensor or Google Fit integration to track steps accurately. You can trust Winwalk to count your steps as accurately as leading step trackers.\r\n\r\n<b>Do I need to keep the app open to count steps?</b>\r\nNo! Winwalk runs in the background, counting steps whether the app is open or closed. Simply walk with your phone, and our pedometer will track your movement throughout the day.\r\n\r\n<b>Can I use multiple devices to track steps?</b>\r\nYou can connect various fitness devices through Google Fit to ensure accurate step counting. However, we don't support direct syncing with reward apps like Wesard, Sweat coin, Cash walk or similar walk to earn apps.\r\n\r\n<b>Can I cash out via Paypal?</b>\r\nCoins can only be redeemed for prepaid gift cards and gift codes. We don\u2019t support Paypal, Venmo, cash transfers or similar for legal reasons.\r\n\r\n<b>Is Winwalk really free?</b>\r\nYes! Our step counter app is completely free. We make money through ads and optional games, allowing us to provide real gift card rewards to our users without any subscription fees.\r\n\r\n<b>Start Walking & Winning Today</b>\r\nWin walk is a top-rated pedometer app for earning rewards, trusted by walkers worldwide.\r\nDownload our free step tracker app now and turn your daily steps into rewards! Our pedometer makes it easy to earn while you walk. Join millions of users who are already getting paid to walk with the most reliable step counter reward app.\r\n\r\nContact us at info@winwalk.club for support or questions.\r\n\r\nNote: This walking reward app is currently available in selected countries only. Using VPN or multiple accounts may result in account suspension.",
    "descriptionHTML": "<b>Get Paid to Walk &amp; Win Gift Cards</b><br>Winwalk is the best step counter app to transform your daily walks into real rewards! Our free pedometer pays you to walk by turning your steps into coins that you can exchange for gift cards from top brands. Whether you&#39;re walking your dog, strolling through the park, or just tracking your fitness activity, winwalk will motivate you to walk more to reach the healthy target of 10,000 daily steps.<br><br><b>Key Winwalk Features</b><br>\ud83d\udeb6 Accurate Step Counter &amp; Pedometer<br>- Precise step tracking using your phone&#39;s built-in sensors or Google Fit<br>- Track steps, distance walked, calories burned, and active time<br>- Compatible with all major fitness trackers and smartwatches via Google Fit<br>- Syncs with Google Fit for enhanced accuracy and reduced battery usage<br><br>\ud83d\udcb0 Walk and Earn Real Rewards<br>- Earn 1 coin for every 100 steps you take<br>- Collect up to 100 coins daily by reaching your 10,000 steps goal<br>- Exchange coins for popular gift cards (Amazon, Walmart, Google Play, and more)<br>- Instant rewards delivery - no waiting time for payouts<br><br>\ud83d\udd12 Private &amp; Secure<br>- No registration or personal info required<br>- Anonymous step tracking without GPS monitoring<br>- Free to use with no hidden fees or subscriptions<br>- Simple and easy-to-use walking app<br><br><b>How to Earn Money Walking?</b><br>1. Download our free step tracker app<br>2. Start walking and collect coins<br>3. Participate in extra missions to maximize your earnings<br>4. Redeem coins for gift cards in the rewards shop<br>5. Receive your gift card instantly in the app<br><br><b>Smartwatch Integration</b><br>Connect your favorite fitness devices through Google Fit (and soon Health Connect): Fitbit step tracker, Samsung Health smartwatch, Garmin fitness tracker, Mi Band - And many more!<br>Connecting your smartwatch to Google Fit may require the use of a third-party ap